## `EntityFilter` carries the kinds `from_str` can produce; upstream's other variants are never built. `nbt` parses to
## upstream's `NbtCompound::default()`, so it filters nothing there either.
##
## `server.select_players` and `select_entities` are the `selectPlayers` and `selectEntities` hooks.

